<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 191,958.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 191,958.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 10 totaled 191,958 bales, down from 192,244 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 347 bales issued, 1,634 bales awaiting review, 633 cancellations, and 8,900 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
